[3.953s] 12:             <div><strong>Câmera (40m, 90°):</strong> ${g.in_camera ? 'DENTRO' : 'FORA'} (Pitch: ${(g.pitch_deg||0).toFixed(1)}°)</div>
[3.953s] 12:             <div><strong>Pose Relativa:</strong> dx=${r.rel_x.toFixed(1)}m, dy=${r.rel_y.toFixed(1)}m, z=${r.altitude_z.toFixed(1)}m</div>
