[4.386s] 12:             <div><strong>LiDAR (100m, 120°):</strong> ${g.in_lidar ? 'DENTRO' : 'FORA'} (Elev: ${(g.elev_deg||0).toFixed(1)}°)</div>
[4.386s] 12:             <div><strong>Câmera (40m, 90°):</strong> ${g.in_camera ? 'DENTRO' : 'FORA'} (Pitch: ${(g.pitch_deg||0).toFixed(1)}°)</div>
[4.386s] 12:             <div><strong>Pose Relativa:</strong> dx=${r.rel_x.toFixed(1)}m, dy=${r.rel_y.toFixed(1)}m, z=${r.altitude_z.toFixed(1)}m</div>
[4.386s] 12:             <div><strong>Requisito Primordial:</strong> <span style="color:${g.in_any ? 'var(--green)':'var(--red)'}; font-weight:bold;">${g.in_any ? 'ATENDIDO (100%)' : 'VIOLADO'}</span></div>
